Build diagnostics-hierarchy for Fuchsia only, without test deps (milestone M9b).

On host, upstream builds it with schemars (feature json_schema): outside pilot 1's
closure (docs/closure/pilot1.json: this crate is used from Fuchsia code only). The host
branch is emptied and the target marked Fuchsia-only.

test_deps are dropped: //rules:rustc.bzl makes no unit tests until milestone M16, and
regen.py would otherwise fetch crates outside the closure (assert_matches, serde_json,
test-case) or fail on in-tree test deps it does not vendor (//src/lib/fuchsia, and on
host //src/developer/ffx/lib/writer:lib).

The added lines are the overlay's (Apache-2.0); the context lines are Fuchsia's
(BSD-2-Clause, LICENSES/BSD-2-Clause.txt). Applied by scripts/regen.py to the rewritten
BUILD.bazel.

--- a/src/lib/diagnostics/hierarchy/rust/BUILD.bazel
+++ b/src/lib/diagnostics/hierarchy/rust/BUILD.bazel
@@ -28,16 +28,8 @@
         "@rust_crates//vendor:num-derive",
         "@rust_crates//vendor:paste",
     ],
-    test_deps = [
-        "//vendor/fuchsia/src/lib/fuchsia",
-        "@rust_crates//vendor:assert_matches",
-        "@rust_crates//vendor:serde_json",
-        "@rust_crates//vendor:test-case",
-    ] + select({
-        # Contains a one-line check for a schema.
-        "//rules:is_host_os": ["//vendor/fuchsia/src/developer/ffx/lib/writer:lib"],
-        "//conditions:default": [],
-    }),
+    # Overlay: unit tests are milestone M16 (patch 0001).
+    test_deps = [],
     version = "0.1.0",
     visibility = ["//vendor/fuchsia:__subpackages__"],
     with_unit_tests = True,
@@ -51,7 +43,10 @@
         "@rust_crates//vendor:serde",
         "@rust_crates//vendor:thiserror",
     ] + select({
-        "//rules:is_host_os": ["@rust_crates//vendor:schemars"],
+        # Overlay: no host build (patch 0001).
+        "//rules:is_host_os": [],
         "//conditions:default": [],
     }),
+    # Overlay: Fuchsia only (patch 0001).
+    target_compatible_with = ["@platforms//os:fuchsia"],
 )
